<title>CANADA: Bank of Canada to auction C$1 bln of 21-day bills.</title>
<headline>Bank of Canada to auction C$1 bln of 21-day bills.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Canada plans to auction C$1.0 billion of 21-day treasury bills on September 19, the central bank said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>The bills will be delivered on September 19 and mature on October 10, the Bank said.</p>
<p>Auction results will be released tomorrow at 1130 EDT/1530 GMT, the Bank said.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
